## Cloudflare R2

Lament uses **Cloudflare R2** (S3-compatible) for storing:

- **HLS audio segments** (`.m3u8` playlists and `.ts` segments)
- **Cover artwork** (album covers, artist images)
- **Processed images** (WebP conversions)

## Access

R2 is accessed via the AWS SDK S3-compatible client:

```typescript
import { S3Client } from '@aws-sdk/client-s3';

const s3 = new S3Client({
  region: 'auto',
  endpoint: `https://${R2_ACCOUNT_ID}.r2.cloudflarestorage.com`,
  credentials: {
    accessKeyId: R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID,
    secretAccessKey: R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
  }
});
```

## File Organization

```
R2 bucket/
├── audio/
│   └── {track-id}/
│       ├── playlist.m3u8
│       ├── segment-000.ts
│       ├── segment-001.ts
│       └── ...
├── covers/
│   ├── tracks/
│   ├── albums/
│   └── artists/
```

## Image Processing

The scraper uses `sharp` for image processing before upload:

- Resize to standard dimensions
- Convert to WebP format
- Optimize file size
